# Byte-for-byte fixtures: the wire captures and golden files the crates' tests compare against are
# copies of another program's output (Go's, an Engine's), some with CRLF line ends that are the
# bytes under test, so no line-end conversion (a core.autocrlf of input or true would rewrite them).
# The whitespace pre-commit hooks skip the same directories.
crates/*/tests/testdata/** -text
